Table full name: mitelman-db.prod.Reference
Column name: RefNo Type: INT64 Description: reference number from 10 to 15880
Column name: TitleLength Type: INT64 Description: length of title, up to 334
Column name: TitleShort Type: STRING Description: short or truncated title, eg aThe myeloperoxidase gene in acute promyelocytic leukemia'
Column name: TitleLong Type: STRING Description: blank for shorter titles, otherwise the full title is in this field
Column name: Volume Type: STRING Description: journal volume, eg '95:96-101'
Column name: Year Type: INT64 Description: publication year, eg '1998'
Column name: Journal Type: STRING Description: journal name abbreviation, eg 'Cancer Genet Cytogenet'
Column name: Text Type: STRING Description: this field is always blank
Column name: Abbreviation Type: STRING Description: author abbreviation, eg 'Park et al 2009'
Column name: AuthorsLength Type: STRING Description: author string length, up to 2411
Column name: AuthorsShort Type: STRING Description: short or truncated author string, eg 'Atkin NB, Baker MC'
Column name: AuthorsLong Type: STRING Description: blank or complete, long author string
Column name: Flag Type: STRING Description: this field is always blank
